          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This product uses Hybrid Transformer Demucs by Meta Platforms, Inc. and WhisperKit by Argmax, Inc. The HTDemucs model and weights, Demucs source code, and WhisperKit source code are provided under the MIT License. This project is not affiliated with Apple, Argmax, Meta, OpenAI, or the Demucs authors.": {
