            "value": "This product uses Hybrid Transformer Demucs by Meta Platforms, Inc. and WhisperKit by Argmax, Inc. The HTDemucs model and weights, Demucs source code, and WhisperKit source code are provided under the MIT License. This project is not affiliated with Apple, Argmax, Meta, OpenAI, or the Demucs authors."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本产品使用 Meta Platforms, Inc. 的 Hybrid Transformer Demucs 和 Argmax, Inc. 的 WhisperKit。HTDemucs 模型及权重、Demucs 源代码和 WhisperKit 源代码均采用 MIT 许可证。本项目与 Apple、Argmax、Meta、OpenAI 或 Demucs 作者不存在隶属关系。"
          }
